      "message": "OK, I think I get how it works. Only in the success case does it call `send_response`. In the failure case, the response is edited but then discarded, and the caller sees a different blank response.\n\nIf that\u0027s accurate, then the behavior of this function is as I might have expected. I\u0027m not sure if that merits a comment or if it would be obvious to someone more familiar with Zephyr emulators. Up to you.",
