      "message": "This one kind of does seem like it would do a partial write in the event of an invalid index after `vdo_types[0]`. Again, if you know the behavior of the actual part, this should emulate that.\n\nSince this is just used for tests, if no test case depends on this emulator behavior, then it\u0027s fine to leave it undecided for now. You might want to explain the current behavior in a comment.",
